# .opencodeignore - human reference only
#
# NOTE: OpenCode does NOT natively read a `.opencodeignore` file. There is no
# such key in the official schema (https://opencode.ai/config.json). This file
# documents the paths that should stay out of LLM context; the actual
# enforcement lives in `opencode.json`:
#   - `permission.read` (deny patterns)
#   - `watcher.ignore`
#
# Keep bulky or sensitive paths out of context:
.env
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
# Keep Playwright screenshots (visual evidence) visible; ignore only the
# bulky raw dumps (console logs + accessibility snapshots).
.playwright-mcp/*.log
.playwright-mcp/*.yml
frontend/dist/**
backend/.pytest_cache/**
**/*.pyc
**/__pycache__/**
